(6773002, 1015701, 138174, '<td valign="top">ouch</td>', 'ouch', '2012-05-19 03:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773024, 1015701, 142363, '<td valign="top">I think it''s an absolutely gorgeous portrait - it isn''t something that FOR ME epitomizes "spring" in a traditional / non-traditional interpretation.  But I keep coming back to it - if this is a client, I would think they were ABSOLUTELY thrilled with the result - if it''s a self-portrait, HOORAH sister!  Just wanted to share that - because I LOVED it from an artistic perspective, even if it wasn''t one of my top votes for "spring"</td>', 'I think it''s an absolutely gorgeous portrait - it isn''t something that FOR ME epitomizes "spring" in a traditional / non-traditional interpretation.  But I keep coming back to it - if this is a client, I would think they were ABSOLUTELY thrilled with the result - if it''s a self-portrait, HOORAH sister!  Just wanted to share that - because I LOVED it from an artistic perspective, even if it wasn''t one of my top votes for "spring"', '2012-05-19 08:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773371, 1015677, 86447, '<td valign="top">Could be brighter to be prettier, but I like the composition.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Could be brighter to be prettier, but I like the composition.  (commenting only)', '2012-05-19 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773395, 1015629, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love these leading lines!<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I love these leading lines!   (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773396, 1015509, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is a bit too... harsh for me to love.<br/> <br/>I do like the idea here.. .the composition is wonderful, too.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'This is a bit too... harsh for me to love. I do like the idea here.. .the composition is wonderful, too.  (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773401, 1015791, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think the harsh colors are throwing this wonderful image off.<br/> <br/>I wish it were in BW... so we could focus on the fabulous composition and lights and darks of the animals.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'I think the harsh colors are throwing this wonderful image off. I wish it were in BW... so we could focus on the fabulous composition and lights and darks of the animals.  (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773402, 1015633, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!   I love the dark edges... the subtle colors... and the focus on the center.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Very pretty!   I love the dark edges... the subtle colors... and the focus on the center.   (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773404, 1015172, 86447, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, although this is a fabulously romantic image, the oranges and reds remind me of the alternate challenge (with fewer entries)... I know it''s actually more Springlike with the blossoms... but the colors are throwing me off.<br/> <br/>I love... love...love ... that spot of purple flowers above the swan.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Unfortunately, although this is a fabulously romantic image, the oranges and reds remind me of the alternate challenge (with fewer entries)... I know it''s actually more Springlike with the blossoms... but the colors are throwing me off. I love... love...love ... that spot of purple flowers above the swan.  (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773405, 1015757, 86447, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty.  Love the bokeh.<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'This is very pretty.  Love the bokeh.  (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773406, 1015591, 86447, '<td valign="top">Almost... SUMMER with those brilliant cool colors!  <br/> <br/>Fabulous image... but not exactly "Spring".<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Almost... SUMMER with those brilliant cool colors!   Fabulous image... but not exactly "Spring".  (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6773407, 1015692, 86447, '<td valign="top">Oh... I love those babies!<br/> <br/> <br/>I wish they and their mom were a bit more in focus... but what a sweet scene!<br/> <br/> <br/>(commenting only)</td>', 'Oh... I love those babies!  I wish they and their mom were a bit more in focus... but what a sweet scene!  (commenting only)', '2012-05-20 01:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
