(6775826, 1015547, 65234, '<td valign="top">It does have a wonderful Oriental feel to it.  Really like this.  I was thinking a more pastel background would "feel" more like Spring, but then one of the wonders of the season is the new green arising from the brown of winter.  It''s great just as it is.</td>', 'It does have a wonderful Oriental feel to it.  Really like this.  I was thinking a more pastel background would "feel" more like Spring, but then one of the wonders of the season is the new green arising from the brown of winter.  It''s great just as it is.', '2012-05-22 22:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775827, 1015794, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy.  I''d like to see a little more brightness in his eye.</td>', 'Cute little guy.  I''d like to see a little more brightness in his eye.', '2012-05-22 22:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775828, 1015763, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the green background letting the blossoms take center stage.</td>', 'Love the green background letting the blossoms take center stage.', '2012-05-22 22:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775830, 1015658, 54446, '<td valign="top">Great use of narrow DOF.  Delightful bg bokeh.  Bumping up the score because I think this deserves to win the Spring challenge.  10</td>', 'Great use of narrow DOF.  Delightful bg bokeh.  Bumping up the score because I think this deserves to win the Spring challenge.  10', '2012-05-22 22:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6775837, 1015217, 54446, '<td valign="top">Kudos to you on this magnificent capture.  Your timing is impeccable.  Amazing wingspan extended detail.  The light is a bit harsh, but if you hadn''t had full sunlight, you wouldn''t have been able to freeze the action so professionally.  Okay, it''s a 10.</td>', 'Kudos to you on this magnificent capture.  Your timing is impeccable.  Amazing wingspan extended detail.  The light is a bit harsh, but if you hadn''t had full sunlight, you wouldn''t have been able to freeze the action so professionally.  Okay, it''s a 10.', '2012-05-22 22:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
