(6789522, 1015422, 18505, '<td valign="top">Very nice light.  You might want to try cropping just a bit more off the top, though.  If you cropped down to the lowest semi-circle of the yellow band, you would retain the impression of sunshine (especially with all the nice light rays) without having to contend with the blown gray sun blob, or the impression that the image is tilted.  One of the true beauties of the Grand Canyon is the variety of colors which shimmer in the light.  I don''t know if you could bring back some of those colors through your tone-mapping, but if you could, you would have a spectacular effect.  With a few more tweaks, this could be off the charts outstanding.</td>', 'Very nice light.  You might want to try cropping just a bit more off the top, though.  If you cropped down to the lowest semi-circle of the yellow band, you would retain the impression of sunshine (especially with all the nice light rays) without having to contend with the blown gray sun blob, or the impression that the image is tilted.  One of the true beauties of the Grand Canyon is the variety of colors which shimmer in the light.  I don''t know if you could bring back some of those colors through your tone-mapping, but if you could, you would have a spectacular effect.  With a few more tweaks, this could be off the charts outstanding.', '2012-06-07 21:57:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6797120, 1015692, 35602, '<td valign="top">This is very cute.  However, cute does not always cut it with DP.  They are looking for something that isn''t so obvious.  They would consider this a lazy photo, one that you did not actively engage in, you simply happened to be in the right place at the right time, snapped a good photo, and submitted.  Still, the score is 5.5, so it had some aesthetic appeal with voters.</td>', 'This is very cute.  However, cute does not always cut it with DP.  They are looking for something that isn''t so obvious.  They would consider this a lazy photo, one that you did not actively engage in, you simply happened to be in the right place at the right time, snapped a good photo, and submitted.  Still, the score is 5.5, so it had some aesthetic appeal with voters.', '2012-06-17 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6923359, 1015652, 152252, '<td valign="top">Great macro. Very nice composition. B&amp;W definitely a plus. I can feel the life coming back after winter when I look at it...</td>', 'Great macro. Very nice composition. B&W definitely a plus. I can feel the life coming back after winter when I look at it...', '2012-12-05 01:49:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(6970784, 1015770, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is a typical image that, when examined it in the context of a challenge - its placement 69 of 131 - makes me wonder if people really look at things. <br/></td>', 'This is a typical image that, when examined it in the context of a challenge - its placement 69 of 131 - makes me wonder if people really look at things. ', '2013-02-03 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6971290, 1015770, 12611, '<td valign="top">Super work, the grain, the antiqued feel is right on many levels.</td>', 'Super work, the grain, the antiqued feel is right on many levels.', '2013-02-04 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 0);
